; A misplaced or removed tag in an imported module is reported in that
; module's own source. Here `TagStray` carries a `restrict(...)` tag
; above a `data` declaration (AX3077) and a removed `precondition(...)`
; tag (AX3095), and both lines must point into `TagStray.ax`. The
; stray-tag pass runs before the body walk stamps each declaration's
; unit, so it stamps the unit itself.
;
; The entry file's own misplaced tag, on `Mode`, stays here.
(import TagStray)

;@axiom:restrict(no-io)
(data Mode
  (Fast)
  (Slow))

(:: main Int)
(fn (main)
  (halve 4))
